#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0323 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
# Rule:Description: Within a study, there is more than one value of APHASEN for a given value of APHASE, considering only those rows on which both variables are populated
# Declared-tier scope: structure= states the ADaM data structure this minimal table stands for;
# #define is its mandatory carrier (ScenarioDeclaredScopeProvider.install).
#define standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC structure=BDS
col APHASEN type=Char
col APHASE type=Char
---
Label A | A
Label B | B
Label A | A
---
